&lt;p&gt;Sending through channel is synchronous. This means it blocks if channel is full.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A common pattern: making a channel and returning it; instead of returning value returning the channel and pushing the value into the channel.&lt;/p&gt;
