&lt;p&gt;To close a channel: &lt;code&gt;defer close(channel)&lt;/code&gt;; A channel can only be closed once. GC will collect a channel regardless of it is closed or not (if it is not referenced).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>